- **`app/auth.py:9`** — `require_api_key` now checks `X-API-Key` against `VALID_API_KEYS`, raises 401 on missing/invalid, returns the username on success.
- **`app/main.py:18`** — `GET /tasks` accepts optional `status` (validated as `TaskStatus`), `priority`, `assigned_to`; filters combine; then `page`/`page_size` slice (defaults 1/20) applied after filtering.
- **`app/main.py:46`** — `POST /tasks`: auth via `Depends(require_api_key)`, 404 if `project_id` not in `projects`, ID = `max(existing)+1`, returns the task with 201.
- **`app/main.py:61`** — `PUT /tasks/{task_id}`: auth, 404 if missing, applies only fields sent (`exclude_unset=True`).
- **`app/main.py:77`** — `DELETE /tasks/{task_id}`: auth, 404 if missing, 204 on success.

